{
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "platforms": [
    {
      "name": "雪球",
      "domains": [
        "xueqiu.com"
      ],
      "last_verified": "2026-09-16",
      "post_selectors": [
        "article.timeline__item",
        ".timeline__item",
        ".timeline__live tr"
      ],
      "timestamp": {
        "selector": "a.date-and-source, td:first-child",
        "type": "relative",
        "strip_pattern": "^修改于",
        "date_text_selector": ".home__timeline-live__hd",
        "date_text_scope_selector": ".timeline__live",
        "patterns": [
          {
            "regex": "^(\\d+)秒前",
            "unit": "second",
            "multiplier": 1
          },
          {
            "regex": "^刚刚",
            "unit": "second",
            "multiplier": 0
          },
          {
            "regex": "^(\\d+)分钟前",
            "unit": "minute",
            "multiplier": 1
          },
          {
            "regex": "^(\\d+)小时前",
            "unit": "hour",
            "multiplier": 1
          },
          {
            "regex": "^昨天$",
            "unit": "day",
            "multiplier": 1
          },
          {
            "regex": "^(\\d+)天前",
            "unit": "day",
            "multiplier": 1
          }
        ],
        "attr": null
      },
      "comment_selectors": [
        ".comment__item"
      ],
      "comment_timestamp_selector": "span.time",
      "feed_context": {
        "path_patterns": [
          "^/$"
        ],
        "active_selectors": [
          ".home-timeline-tabs a.active",
          ".timeline__tab__tags a.active"
        ],
        "trigger_selectors": [
          ".home-timeline-tabs a",
          ".timeline__tab__tags a"
        ],
        "wait_ms": 350,
        "completeness": "loaded-only",
        "backfill": {
          "contexts": [
            "7x24",
            "关注 / 全部"
          ],
          "scroll_delay_ms": 1200,
          "max_screens": 10,
          "target_hits": 10,
          "end_stall_count": 2,
          "load_more_selector": "a.home__timeline__more"
        }
      },
      "quick_presets": [
        {
          "label": "1小时前",
          "value": "1_hour_ago"
        },
        {
          "label": "今日0点",
          "value": "today_midnight"
        },
        {
          "label": "昨日0点",
          "value": "yesterday_midnight"
        },
        {
          "label": "今天09:15",
          "value": "today_0915"
        },
        {
          "label": "今天09:30",
          "value": "today_0930"
        },
        {
          "label": "昨日收盘前",
          "value": "yesterday_1500"
        }
      ],
      "virtual_pagination": {
        "list_selector": ".stock-timeline > .status-list",
        "post_id": {
          "selector": "a.date-and-source",
          "attr": "data-id"
        },
        "source_link_selector": "a.date-and-source",
        "context_selector": ".stock-timeline-tabs a.active",
        "context_trigger_selector": ".stock-timeline-tabs a",
        "context_wait_ms": 1000,
        "empty_selector": ".stock-timeline > .empty",
        "native_pagination_selector": ".stock-timeline > .pagination",
        "next_selector": ".pagination__next",
        "active_page_selector": ".pagination a.active",
        "first_page": {
          "input_selector": ".pagination input",
          "value": "1"
        },
        "page_size": 10,
        "max_source_pages": 200,
        "wait_ms": 800,
        "next_delay_min_ms": 400,
        "next_delay_max_ms": 800
      },
      "notes": "DOM 取证于 2026-08-14：首页一级类别由 .home-timeline-tabs a.active 标识，关注（全部/关注精选/只看原发/未分组）和自选（全部/公告/新闻）二级类别由 .timeline__tab__tags a.active 标识；普通首页流使用 article.timeline__item、a.date-and-source[data-id]，7x24 使用 .timeline__live tr，并将分组标题 .home__timeline-live__hd 与行内首列时间组合解析。首页均为智能流或按需加载流，明确标记为仅过滤已加载内容；其中 7x24 与关注流为严格时间序，声明 backfill 支持用户手动触发的连续补拉（滚动节流 1200ms，上限 10 屏），热度/智能流不声明、不做不可信回溯。个股页全部/讨论/投资者关系/交易/资讯/公告六类共用 .stock-timeline > .status-list、article.timeline__item、a.date-and-source[data-id] 与原生分页；类别由 .stock-timeline-tabs a.active 标识，切换类别时重建独立虚拟分页会话。编辑帖格式为 '修改于MM-DD HH:mm'。虚拟分页跨原生页按需聚合，每虚拟页 10 条，单次会话最多扫描 200 个原生页。详情页评论 .comment__item，时间戳 span.time。2026-09-16 真机复核：7x24（.timeline__live tr）与关注/全部（article.timeline__item）行选择器均有效（滚动实测 10→30、15→30 行并全部完成过滤）；两上下文均由滚动触发无限加载，候选按钮 a.home__timeline__more 在补拉全程 display:none，『加载更多』未观测到可见态，故 load_more_selector 按防御性声明（引擎有可见性门控）。"
    },
    {
      "name": "同花顺",
      "domains": [
        "t.10jqka.com.cn"
      ],
      "post_selectors": [
        "li.feed-item",
        ".feed-item"
      ],
      "timestamp": {
        "selector": ".feed-item-timeline-time",
        "type": "custom",
        "format": "MMDD HH:mm",
        "attr": null,
        "date_attr": "data-date"
      },
      "comment_selectors": [],
      "comment_timestamp_selector": "",
      "quick_presets": [
        {
          "label": "1小时前",
          "value": "1_hour_ago"
        },
        {
          "label": "今日0点",
          "value": "today_midnight"
        },
        {
          "label": "昨日0点",
          "value": "yesterday_midnight"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "DOM 取证于 2026-08-11：首页信息流 li.feed-item（实测 36 条），日期在容器 data-date 属性（MMDD，如 0811），时间在 .feed-item-timeline-time（HH:mm）。组合为 'MMDD HH:mm'，无年份需补当年并处理跨年。评论选择器待 P2-4 取证。"
    },
    {
      "name": "集思录",
      "domains": [
        "jisilu.cn",
        "www.jisilu.cn"
      ],
      "post_selectors": [
        ".aw-question-list > .aw-item",
        ".aw-dynamic-topic > .aw-item[id^='answer_list_']"
      ],
      "timestamp": {
        "selector": "span.aw-text-color-999",
        "type": "absolute",
        "format": "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm",
        "extract_pattern": "(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}\\s+\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}(?::\\d{2})?)"
      },
      "active_paths": [
        "^/category/",
        "^/question/",
        "^/home/explore/sort_type"
      ],
      "quick_presets": [
        {
          "label": "1小时前",
          "value": "1_hour_ago"
        },
        {
          "label": "今日0点",
          "value": "today_midnight"
        },
        {
          "label": "昨日0点",
          "value": "yesterday_midnight"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "DOM 取证于 2026-08-17（无登录态，全程 200）与 2026-08-18 复核：分类主题列表 .aw-question-list > .aw-item，时间在 span.aw-text-color-999 行内文本（作者 回复 • YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm • N 次浏览），全年份绝对时间无跨年歧义；详情回复 .aw-dynamic-topic > .aw-item[id^='answer_list_'] 一次渲染，回复时间在 .aw-dynamic-topic-meta .pull-left.aw-text-color-999。分页为服务端 URL（home/explore/sort_type-*__page-N），URL 即上下文。局限：选择器为单快照样本，大帖回复分页/懒加载机制未验证；裸首页 explore 无时间戳，不启用。"
    },
    {
      "name": "东方财富资讯",
      "domains": [
        "finance.eastmoney.com"
      ],
      "post_selectors": [
        "li[id^='newsTr']"
      ],
      "timestamp": {
        "selector": "p.time",
        "type": "absolute",
        "format": "YYYY年MM月DD日 HH:mm"
      },
      "active_paths": [
        "^/a/[a-z]+(_\\d+)?\\.html$"
      ],
      "quick_presets": [
        {
          "label": "1小时前",
          "value": "1_hour_ago"
        },
        {
          "label": "今日0点",
          "value": "today_midnight"
        },
        {
          "label": "昨日0点",
          "value": "yesterday_midnight"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "DOM 取证于 2026-08-18：证券聚焦 a/czqyw.html 与股市评论 a/cgspl.html 双栏目同模板（41-42 条/页），列表 li[id^='newsTr']（有图/无图两变体均含 .text），时间 p.time 为 YYYY年MM月DD日 HH:mm 全年份绝对时间；分页 {栏目}_{n}.html 服务端 URL，栏目即上下文。active_paths 排除 /a/{数字}.html 正文页（无列表时间流，正文页不启用过滤）。选择器为单快照样本待真机验收。"
    }
  ]
}
